# Clause 10: Improvement

## Overview
Clause 10 addresses the continual improvement of the ISMS and the management of nonconformities and corrective actions.

## Gaps in this Clause

| Gap | Title | Risk | Status |
|-----|-------|------|--------|
| GAP-017 | Continual Improvement | HIGH | Not Implemented |
| GAP-018 | Nonconformity and Corrective Action | HIGH | Not Implemented |

## Key Requirements

- Establish a process for continual improvement
- Identify improvement opportunities
- Manage nonconformities
- Implement corrective actions
- Verify effectiveness of improvements

## Remediation Priority

**CRITICAL** — These are essential processes for maintaining and improving the ISMS over time. Without them, the ISMS becomes static and ineffective.
